WEBVTT

00:00:00.593 --> 00:00:01.310
Hi there!

00:00:01.306 --> 00:00:02.990
Welcome to the Tositeo course.

00:00:03.094 --> 00:00:06.705
Tositeo helps small business owners keep every receipt,

00:00:06.655 --> 00:00:09.230
travel claim and document in one place,

00:00:09.404 --> 00:00:11.150
and send them straight to the accountant.

00:00:11.419 --> 00:00:17.175
Nail salons, restaurants, shops and service companies can all use it, in Finland,

00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:17.950
in Germany,

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.470
and in many other countries.

00:00:19.661 --> 00:00:20.430
Lesson one:

00:00:20.781 --> 00:00:23.550
create your account, and set up your company correctly.

00:00:24.069 --> 00:00:26.106
Go to tositeo.com.

00:00:26.521 --> 00:00:28.826
The home page shows the three main jobs:

00:00:28.849 --> 00:00:31.014
snapping receipts, making travel claims,

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:34.346
and finding missing receipts by matching them against the bank.

00:00:34.692 --> 00:00:38.506
Business owners use it free for three years, with no payment card needed.

00:00:38.704 --> 00:00:40.906
For accounting firms, it's always free.

00:00:41.175 --> 00:00:43.386
Click Use free for 3 years.

00:00:44.049 --> 00:00:46.763
At the top, choose your language, English.

00:00:47.029 --> 00:00:49.323
Tositeo speaks thirty languages.

00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:50.923
Choose the Business tab.

00:00:51.192 --> 00:00:55.483
Fill in your name, the company name, and the country where the company operates.

00:00:55.837 --> 00:00:58.363
The business ID is optional, you can add it later.

00:00:58.779 --> 00:01:02.689
Enter your work e-mail, and a password of at least ten characters,

00:01:02.639 --> 00:01:04.443
with both letters and numbers.

00:01:04.792 --> 00:01:08.603
Tick the box to accept the terms, then click Create account.

00:01:09.232 --> 00:01:10.297
Your account is ready.

00:01:10.479 --> 00:01:11.977
This is the Overview page.

00:01:12.246 --> 00:01:14.457
The four boxes at the top tell you right away:

00:01:14.661 --> 00:01:18.705
Expenses this month, Drafts to complete, what's Waiting for your approval,

00:01:18.655 --> 00:01:20.377
and Payments without a receipt.

00:01:20.806 --> 00:01:23.817
Below are your Latest receipts, and the quick Add buttons:

00:01:23.847 --> 00:01:26.617
Receipt, Paid with own money, and Travel claim.

00:01:27.213 --> 00:01:30.542
Click the three-line button in the top left corner to open the menu.

00:01:30.989 --> 00:01:32.862
The top part is for everyday work:

00:01:32.956 --> 00:01:36.622
Receipts, Travel claims, Approvals and Documents.

00:01:36.971 --> 00:01:41.582
The Finance group has Bank & card, Reimbursements, and Export to accounting.

00:01:42.087 --> 00:01:45.342
The Settings group has Company, Team, and Your accountant.

00:01:45.895 --> 00:01:48.479
The most important job is setting up your company.

00:01:48.724 --> 00:01:50.479
In the menu, choose Company.

00:01:50.908 --> 00:01:52.479
Check the Country of operation:

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:57.519
Tositeo uses that country's VAT rates, currency, and business ID format.

00:01:57.868 --> 00:02:01.110
Fill in the business ID, the address, and the company IBAN,

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:03.599
the account that reimbursements are paid from.

00:02:04.193 --> 00:02:06.117
If your company is outside Finland,

00:02:06.067 --> 00:02:09.277
enter the travel allowance rates set by your country's law:

00:02:09.579 --> 00:02:13.837
the rate per kilometre, the full day allowance, and the partial day allowance.

00:02:14.255 --> 00:02:19.037
In Finland, Tositeo uses the official Tax Administration rates automatically.

00:02:19.466 --> 00:02:20.865
Tick Expenses need approval,

00:02:20.815 --> 00:02:23.997
if you want to see each expense before it goes to the accountant.

00:02:24.106 --> 00:02:27.414
Choose after how many days to remind about missing receipts,

00:02:27.364 --> 00:02:28.717
then click Save changes.

00:02:29.066 --> 00:02:32.547
The Rules box below sums up the VAT rates, the tax authority,

00:02:32.497 --> 00:02:34.797
and how many years to keep your records.

00:02:35.383 --> 00:02:39.033
Finally, click your initials in the top corner to open your profile.

00:02:39.368 --> 00:02:41.406
Under Your IBAN, enter your own account,

00:02:41.356 --> 00:02:43.593
so you get back the money you paid yourself.

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:45.513
You can change the language here too.

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:47.833
Then click Save profile.

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:49.435
That's the setup done.

00:02:49.673 --> 00:02:52.075
In the next lesson, we'll snap our first receipt.

00:02:52.424 --> 00:02:54.315
Now take the quiz below the video.
